<title>JAPAN: BOJ director to appear in parliament on Tuesday.</title>
<headline>BOJ director to appear in parliament on Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yutaka Yamaguchi, an executive director of the Bank of Japan, will answer questions at a meeting of the finance committee of the Upper House of parliament on Tuesday morning, the BOJ said in a statement.</p>
<p>Yamaguchi has been asked to appear before the committee from 10.05 a.m. (0105 GMT) to 11.55 a.m. (0255 GMT), the BOJ said.</p>
<p>It gave no other details.</p>
</text>
